# collected for is the exported metric dumps -- raw-*.csv, vraw-*.csv, det-*.csv
# -- which are tracked, human-readable, and what the analysis actually cites.
#
# See the branch's earlier cleanup commit: 25 MB of SASS dumps and compiled
# binaries had to be untracked after they made a PR read 292k additions.
*.ncu-rep
